%% A4 Fig 2: the /ask write path. Both branches end at the same INSERT, before the client sees anything.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as client
    participant A as api  /ask
    participant P as postgres
    participant E as embedder
    participant G as generator
    C->>A: POST /ask {question}
    A->>P: live snapshot  (index_snapshots WHERE status = 'live')
    A->>E: embed_query(question)
    A->>P: top-k search against idx_<snapshot>
    A->>G: generate(question, context)
    alt the generator answers
        G-->>A: text, tokens, cost
    else it fails: timeout, 5xx, connection refused
        G-->>A: exception  →  status = 'error'
    end
    A->>P: INSERT requests  (every lineage field, on both branches)
    alt ok
        A-->>C: 200 {request_id, answer, citations}
    else error
        A-->>C: 502 {request_id, error}
    end
